index 83edec7..b116fc0 100644
--- a/packages/sdk/README.md
+++ b/packages/sdk/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,13 @@
 # Solana zkAPI SDK
 
+Source SDK `.17` adds `observeWallet(expectedSignature)` for automatic confirmation
+of a saved transaction. It never requests a signature or sends a transaction.
+It updates the existing journal only after the same finalized receipt and account
+checks used by `advanceWallet()`. Pending, unknown and expired attempts stay saved;
+new approvals still require an explicit `advanceWallet()` action. This is a local
+patch candidate, not a published release; existing custody, profiles and verifier
+inputs remain unchanged.
+
 Source SDK `.16` is a local patch candidate for [explicit operator waivers](../../docs/releases/direct-waiver-preview.md); no `.16` GitHub release is claimed. It requires the matching independently pinned client verifier.
 
 SDK/native `.15` adds [explicit direct recovery diagnostics](../../docs/getting-started/direct-recovery-upgrade.md) while preserving existing custody and signed settlement.
